{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/血枪刺","pageid":9224,"revid":22513,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%A1%80%E6%9E%AA%E5%88%BA&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%A1%80%E6%9E%AA%E5%88%BA&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%A1%80%E6%9E%AA%E5%88%BA&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>血枪刺</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E8.A1.80.E6.9E.AA.E5.88.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"血枪刺\"><b>血枪刺</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 血枪刺.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/fe/62nlnjpro5lbvklezzse2xwo23dyyi5.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%A1%80%E6%9E%AA%E5%88%BA.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/fe/62nlnjpro5lbvklezzse2xwo23dyyi5.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%A1%80%E6%9E%AA%E5%88%BA.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/fe/62nlnjpro5lbvklezzse2xwo23dyyi5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />血枪刺\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>普攻\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>1*3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（普攻）选择地形格，对正前方<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有敌人，造成物攻值<font color=\"#ed7950\">60%</font>的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">穿透范围伤害</span>]，并获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"杀气\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">杀气</font></span></span>]。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]，效果：以[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">普攻</span>]或非瞬发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"额外技能\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">额外技能</font></span></span>]攻击后，自身主动[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职业技能</span>]冷却回合减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-1 1*3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c6/am3xc36rmyefvoj7vp6t4v49xrddg0b.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-1_1%2A3.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"81\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c6/am3xc36rmyefvoj7vp6t4v49xrddg0b.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-1_1%2A3.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c6/am3xc36rmyefvoj7vp6t4v49xrddg0b.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-1_1%2A3.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"195\" data-file-height=\"197\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%88%97%E5%A5%A5%E5%B0%BC%E5%BE%B7%E2%80%A2%E5%AF%92%E9%94%8B%E8%A1%80%E8%AA%93\" title=\"角色图鉴库/列奥尼德•寒锋血誓\"><img alt=\"头像 列奥尼德•寒锋血誓.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/5e/psmyam389hualjbfd0utgnbr2hnjsbo.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">列奥尼德•寒锋血誓</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021195350\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.416 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.570 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9740/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 166170/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9489/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  545.333      1 模板:技能\n100.00%  545.333      1 -total\n  7.94%   43.325      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n  7.27%   39.634      6 模板:中括号介绍\n  1.57%    8.548      1 模板:面包屑\n  1.12%    6.112      1 模板:列表/头像\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:9224-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261021195349 and revision id 22513. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"技能","missing":true},{"sortkey":"","category":"毁灭者技能","missing":true}],"images":["技能_血枪刺.png","技能范围_0-1_1*3.png","头像_列奥尼德•寒锋血誓.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"<b>血枪刺</b>","number":"1","index":"T-1","fromtitle":"模板:技能","byteoffset":null,"anchor":"血枪刺"}],"displaytitle":"技能图鉴库/血枪刺","wikitext":"{{技能\n|技能名称=血枪刺\n|技能图标=血枪刺\n|显示名称=\n|攻击方式=范围